# Smart Home IoT — Project Analysis

---

## 1. What This Project Is

A **local + cloud Smart Home controller** built around an **ESP32 (MicroPython)**.

```
Phone Dashboard (HTML/JS)
        ↕  WebSocket + HTTP REST
FastAPI Backend (Laptop)
        ↕  HTTP POST/GET polling
ESP32 (MicroPython)
        ↕  GPIO
Hardware: LEDs, HC-SR04 + SG90 Servo (Radar), Buzzer, Flame sensor, IR sensor
```

